  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"counter-card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.counter-card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 40px 32px;\n  text-align: center;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  width: 100%;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 14px 22px;\n  min-width: 90px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--accent);\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.15);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--accent);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  #count {\n    font-size: 3.8rem;\n  }\n  .counter-card {\n    padding: 28px 20px;\n  }\n  button {\n    flex: 1 1 100%;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA fully offline, dependency-free pixel-style counter web app. Initial value is 0. Supports negative numbers.\n\n## Features\n\n- **+1** button (`id=\"increase\"`) — adds one to the count.\n- **-1** button (`id=\"decrease\"`) — subtracts one from the count.\n- **Reset** button (`id=\"reset\"`) — resets the count to zero.\n- Output element (`id=\"count\"`) displays the current integer only.\n- Negative numbers supported (e.g., -1, -2, ...).\n- Keyboard-accessible: all buttons are focusable and labeled with `aria-label`. Use `Tab` to focus and `Enter`/`Space` to activate.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Click or keyboard-activate the buttons to change the count.\n\nNo network requests, storage, or external assets are used.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup with required IDs.\n- `style.css` — pixel-style theming, responsive layout, hover/focus/pressed states.\n- `script.js` — counter logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Buttons have visible focus outlines.\n- Output uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` for screen reader announcements.\n- Layout works from 360px width.\n\n## Palette\n\n- Background: `#1a1a2e`\n- Card: `#16213e`\n- Accent: `#e94560`\n- Text: `#eaeaea`\n- Muted: `#a0a0b0`",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
